                                                        <span>温馨提示</span> ：
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="pull-left">
                                                        <p>1. <span>同一付款单位可以申请付款，否则请按实际业务进行操作.</span> </p>
                                                        <p>2. <span>申请付款按照每个合同号生成一个申请单.</span> </p>
                                                        <p>3. <span>代理费不允许付款.</span> </p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <div class="col-sm-12" style="padding:0px">
                                        <div class="gridSection">
                                            <table class="aps-table aps-widget aps-ani-transition " id="tblCaseFeeObjects" width="100%">
                                                <colgroup>
                                                    <col style="width: 8%">
                                                    <col style="width: 8%">
                                                    <col style="width: 8%">
                                                    <col style="width: 4%">
                                                    <col style="width: 20%">
                                                    <col style="width: 4%">
                                                </colgroup>
                                                <thead>
                                                    <tr>
                                                        <th>合同号</th>
                                                        <th>案号</th>
                                                        <th>费用类型</th>
                                                        <th>金额</th>
                                                        <th><span><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="javascript: c.Cases.Case.CaseFees.Payment.Objects.ObjectItem.SyncPaymentObject();">收款单位</a></span></th>
                                                        <th>操作</th>
                                                    </tr>
                                                </thead>
                                                <tbody style="position:relative;z-index: 99;"></tbody>
                                            </table>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="i_common_select" id="divAssociatePaymentTypeList_CaseFee" style="position:absolute;z-index: 1000;display: none;">
                                        <div class="i_common_wrap">
                                            <div class="i_common_list"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-footer">
            <div class="btn-con">
                <input type="button" class="btn   btn-primary" style="border-radius: 0;padding: 0 16px; height: 32px;line-height: 30px; font-size: 12px; border-width: 1px;"
